// B3.B3Derivatives.BinaryUmdf.Sbe.v1.7 benchmark.
//
// Reads a capture's datagrams into memory, then times reading them through the Tmp header: every
// datagram parsed, and every field of every message read through get<Field>() and folded into a
// checksum, so no read can be skipped. Each figure is the best of the passes asked for.
//
